Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 08:26:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Fix navigation bar insets, eliminate bottom crowding in
 ChatGPT, and prevent horizontal clipping

- Add WindowInsets.navigationBars() listener and onConfigureWindow in ClipMaxImeService to dynamically offset bottom keyboard padding and navigation bar color
- Reduce key margins to dp(1) and balance row weights to prevent horizontal clipping on narrow/Android Go screens
- Refine QwertyKeyboard spacing (gap-0.5 sm:gap-1.5, p-0.5 sm:p-1.5) and responsive toolbar buttons in KeyboardPanelScreen
- Add explicit in-app test simulation badge distinguishing preview from the native system InputMethodService
- Synchronize compiled web distribution into android/app/src/main/assets/web/
